  "body": "Perched at the highest point on the street to capture sweeping panoramic views, this brand-new two-level home showcases a perfect blend of modern design, comfort, and thoughtful craftsmanship throughout. Set within a convenient and fast-growing neighborhood, it delivers an appealing lifestyle along with strong future value. Sitting on a 336sqm (approx.) section with a 224sqm (approx.) floor area, this property features 4 bedrooms and 3 bathrooms. \r\n\r\nThe ground floor offers a well-designed open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area, creating a bright and functional hub for everyday living. The kitchen is thoughtfully designed to combine style and practicality, featuring sleek cabinetry, quality appliances, and a spacious island bench that serves as both a preparation area and a casual dining spot. Ample storage ensures everything has its place. An additional living space adds valuable flexibility to the home, offering the perfect setting for a second lounge, media room, or quiet retreat. The main living area flows seamlessly out to a deck, ideal for indoor-outdoor living. \r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home is thoughtfully laid out to maximise comfort and privacy. A generous living area providing a versatile space for family relaxation, a kids' lounge, or a quiet retreat.  The master bedroom serves as a relaxing retreat, complete with its own ensuite and a spacious walk-in wardrobe, offering both functionality and a touch of luxury. Three additional bedrooms share a family bathroom, providing convenience and flexibility for family living.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n* Heat pumps\r\n* Intercom\r\n* Single inter-access garage \r\n* Pre-wired EV charger\r\n\r\nDownstairs includes one full bathroom providing both a convenient guest restroom on the lower level and shared access for the upstairs bedrooms, enhancing overall f practicality.\r\n\r\nConveniently located just 3km from Orewa Town Centre and approximately only 5km from Silverdale Shopping Centre, Orewa Beach is just minutes away, while easy motorway access ensures a convenient commute to the city or North Shore.\r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing and experience this exceptional home for yourself.",
